TI  - Classification of Agricultural Pests Through Digital Images Using Deep Learning
FAU - Pedro Costa
FAU - Thiago Matheus De Oliveira Costa
FAU - Larissa Ferreira Rodrigues Moreira
FAU - Leandro Henrique Furtado Pinto Silva
FAU - João Fernando Mari
