TI  - Sheep Behavioral Analysis with Optical Flow
FAU - Pedro Henrique Neves da Silva
FAU - Rodrigo Gonçalves Mateus
FAU - Diego André Sant’Ana
FAU - Sebastião Lucas Neves de Melo
FAU - Hemerson Pistori
